PSEUDOCODE FOR HOMEPAGE
START SkillTrack Portal
Display homepage:
SHOW “SkillTrack training center”
SHOW tagline: "your learning, tracked and supported”
SHOW course buttons:
-software development L3
-web development L2
-data analytics L2
-cybersecurity L2
Wait for users action:
IF user clicks course button:
LOAD course page with tasks, sessions, resources, progress
ELSE IF user clicks “create account”:
Display registration form:
Options: Learner or Assessor/admin
Input: full name
Input: email address
Input: password
Button "create account”
WAIT for form submission:
IF all fields are valid and role selected:
Create new account
Show confirmation message
REDIRECT to dashboard
ELSE:
Show error message
Return to form
END

Pseudocode for login flow
START
DISPLAY “welcome back” login screen
Ask user to " I am a..."
Option 1: learner
Option 2: assessor/admin
STORE role selection
Ask user to enter email
STORE email input
Ask user to enter password
STORE password input
IF email or password is empty:
SHOW “please fill in all fields”
RETURN to login screen
ELSE
VALIDATE credentials (email input, password input and role selection)
IF credentials are valid:
SHOW" login sucessful"
REDIRECT user to dashboard based on role selection
ELSE
SHOW " invalid email or password "
OFFER " trouble signing? Contact your assessor"
END

Pseudocode for Learning Resources
START
DISPLAY " Learning Resources"
SHOW categories: [ All, software dev, web dev, data analytics, cybersecurity and general]
PROMPT user: "select a category"
STORE category selection
FILTER resources by category selection
DISPLAY list of resources with details:
-title
- type (PDF, video, guide, interactive)
-size (mb)
- last updated
-"open" button
PROMPT user: " choose a resource to open "
STORE resource choice
IF resource IS SELECTED THEN
OPEN resources (PDF, video, guide or interactive)
ELSE
DISPLAY " no resources selected"
RETURN to resource list
END

